/T (o Right-clicked on the HTTP GET packet and selected "Follow > TCP Stream". o This feature reassembles and displays the entire application layer conversation  \(request and response\) in chronological order, providing a clear, readable view  of the HTTP headers and body. Practical Insight: This is crucial for debugging application-layer protocols and  confirming that data is exchanged as expected. It also immediately exposes the  lack of encryption in HTTP. )
